## 📅 Day 45 – Rapid Fire Questions Mastery ⚡🎤

> **This is one of the toughest parts of the SSB Interview.**

Many candidates know the answers but fail because they **cannot remember all the questions**.

An officer must be able to **listen carefully, remember accurately, and respond calmly**.

